<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>FindIt | Campus Lost & Found</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/style.css"></head><body>
<header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/">Find<span>It.</span></a><nav class="nav"><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#features">Features</a><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/login">Log in</a><a class="btn" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/register">Get started</a></nav></header>
<main class="container"><section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">Your campus, connected</div><h1>Lost something?<br><span style="color:#4267ee">Let's find it.</span></h1><p>One helpful place for your campus community to report missing belongings, share found items, and reconnect people with what matters.</p><a class="btn" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/register">Join FindIt →</a> <a class="btn secondary" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/login">I already have an account</a></div><div class="hero-card"><div class="eyebrow">The simple way to reunite</div><h2>Small things matter.</h2><p class="muted">A misplaced ID card, a forgotten water bottle, your notes before an exam. Give lost belongings a better chance of getting home.</p><div class="steps" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-bottom:0"><div style="display:flex;gap:12px"><div class="step-num">1</div><div><b>Report it</b><div class="muted">Add the item and where it was lost or found.</div></div></div><div style="display:flex;gap:12px"><div class="step-num">2</div><div><b>Discover matches</b><div class="muted">Browse reports from your campus.</div></div></div><div style="display:flex;gap:12px"><div class="step-num">3</div><div><b>Verify and reunite</b><div class="muted">Submit a claim with identifying details.</div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section id="features"><div class="section-title"><h2>Everything in one place</h2></div><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="step-num">↗</div><h3>Lost & found reports</h3><p class="muted">Publish item details, date, category, colour and location.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="step-num">⌕</div><h3>Smart matching</h3><p class="muted">Find possible matches by category and date, with searchable descriptions.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="step-num">✓</div><h3>Verified claims</h3><p class="muted">Use a verification answer and admin review to manage claims.</p></div></div></section><section id="how"><div class="section-title"><h2>How it works</h2></div><div class="steps"><div class="card"><div class="step-num">1</div><h3>Create an account</h3><p class="muted">Register using your email address.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="step-num">2</div><h3>Post or browse</h3><p class="muted">Add a lost/found report or search existing reports.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="step-num">3</div><h3>Submit a claim</h3><p class="muted">Describe a detail that helps verify ownership.</p></div></div></section></main><footer>FindIt · Smart Campus Lost & Found Platform</footer></body></html>
